{"seconds": 52.0, "exit": 0, "final": "Perfect! Black has won the rook (material count is now 22 vs 26, a +5 advantage). The position shows White is down a whole rook.\n\nSo the clearly best move is **Qd1+**, which wins material by force.\n\n**Coaching Note:**\nWhen your opponent's defender is also their only escape route, force it to choose. **Qd1+** forces White's king to move or the rook to block. If the rook moves to defend (Rf1), capture it with check\u2014you win the rook. If the king moves (Kg2), you've forced it into danger and weakened White's defense. Look for queen checks that threaten multiple pieces at once.\n\n```json\n{\"move\": \"Qd1+\", \"line\": [\"Qd1+\", \"Rf1\", \"Qxf1+\", \"Qg1\", \"Qxg1\"], \"motifs\": [\"fork\", \"deflection\"]}\n```", "tool_calls": [{"tool": "skill", "args": {"skill": "chess-coach"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-board", "args": {"fen": "r5k1/5p2/3N2p1/rNQPp3/P3Pb1p/1P3P1P/3q1R1P/7K b - - 2 38"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-threats", "args": {"fen": "r5k1/5p2/3N2p1/rNQPp3/P3Pb1p/1P3P1P/3q1R1P/7K b - - 2 38"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "r5k1/5p2/3N2p1/rNQPp3/P3Pb1p/1P3P1P/3q1R1P/7K b - - 2 38", "move": "Qd1"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "r5k1/5p2/3N2p1/rNQPp3/P3Pb1p/1P3P1P/3q1R1P/7K b - - 2 38", "move": "Qe1"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "r5k1/5p2/3N2p1/rNQPp3/P3Pb1p/1P3P1P/3q1R1P/7K b - - 2 38", "move": "Qe2"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "r5k1/5p2/3N2p1/rNQPp3/P3Pb1p/1P3P1P/5R1P/3q3K w - - 3 39", "move": "Kg2"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "r5k1/5p2/3N2p1/rNQPp3/P3Pb1p/1P3P1P/5R1P/3q3K w - - 3 39", "move": "Rf1"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "r5k1/5p2/3N2p1/rNQPp3/P3Pb1p/1P3P1P/7P/3q1R1K b - - 4 39", "move": "Qxf1"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "r5k1/5p2/3N2p1/rNQPp3/P3Pb1p/1P3P1P/5RKP/3q4 b - - 4 39", "move": "Qxf3"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args"